decision_conditions:
&lt;p&gt;Details from a suitable conservation accredited specialist (including scaled 
drawings as appropriate) for the following shall be submitted to and approved in 
writing by the Local Planning Authority before the relevant part of the works 
commence:
&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;a) Samples of plasterwork for decorative details to ensure a match as shown 
(this may be required to be made available on site). &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
b) Samples of skirting &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
c) Samples of architraves&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;
REASON: To help protect the special architectural or historic interest of the 
listed building&lt;/p&gt;
